{"action": "add", "accountId": "acct_31c623c5709b451b996c500c", "articles": [{"title": "私有化部署 AI Coding？董事长您先坐下", "author": "ziikoo", "digest": "培训刚结束，董事长说库存 48G 服务器私有化部署一套试试。开放权重不等于能私有化——K3 全量起步约 64 卡与两三千万级硬件。", "content": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:0 auto;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;color:#52525B;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0.3px;overflow-x:hidden;\">\n\n  <section style=\"margin:10px 10px 40px;padding:32px 24px 24px;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;background:#FFFFFF;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 18px;font-weight:400;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">QUOTE</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">开放权重降低了「下载权」，没有降低</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #F97316;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">算力门槛</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"text-align:right;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:16px 0 0;letter-spacing:1px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">—— ziikoo 研究院</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">系列：大模型落地与算力账本 · 整理：ziikoo 研究院 · 2026-07</span><br><span leaf=\"\">素材来自 X 上公开的 Kimi K3 私有化／自托管成本讨论</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">培训结束，十个人的研发团队合上笔记本。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">投影还亮着：演示里模型写代码、改单测、答业务问题，都还像样。董事长点点头：</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"border-left:3px solid #52525B;padding:16px 0 16px 24px;margin:0 10px 28px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\">「AI Coding 能力不错。咱们库房里有几台闲置服务器，单卡 48G 显存，私有化部署一套试试——权重不是开源了吗？」</span>\n  </p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">话落，空气静了两秒。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">不是泼冷水。是这句话把三个完全不同的概念叠在了一起：</span>\n</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n  <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1</span></span>\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">会用 API（培训里刚学会的）</span></p>\n  </section>\n  <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2</span></span>\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">权重开放可下载（新闻标题）</span></p>\n  </section>\n  <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">3</span></span>\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">私有化部署成公司可用服务（真正要的）</span></p>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">三者之间，隔着一整条供应链：显存、互联、机房、电费、运维编制。门槛远超「普通企业用库存机试一把」。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">下面把 X 上关于 </span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">Kimi K3 权重／全量／本地／自托管</span></span><span leaf=\"\"> 的成本评估摊开——不是恐吓，是对齐量级。</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px 40px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:2px;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\">本文看点</span>\n  </p>\n  <section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\">\n    <section style=\"flex:1;background:#FAFAFA;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:18px 12px 16px;margin-right:8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"><span leaf=\"\">48G 库存 vs 1.4TB</span></p>\n    </section>\n    <section style=\"flex:1;background:#FAFAFA;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:18px 12px 16px;margin-right:8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"><span leaf=\"\">三千万只是起步</span></p>\n    </section>\n    <section style=\"flex:1;background:#FAFAFA;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:18px 12px 16px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"><span leaf=\"\">自托管未必更省</span></p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n  <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">01</span>\n    </p>\n    <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">SCALE</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">先对齐：K3 是什么量级</span>\n      </h3>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">社区对 K3 的常见描述（口径会随官方 README 微调，以开源日为准）：</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"margin:0 10px 24px;overflow-x:auto;\">\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;\">\n    <thead><tr><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">项</span></th><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">社区说法</span></th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">总参数</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">约 2.8T，MoE</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">路由</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">约 896 选 16，每次激活约 500 亿参数</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">量化体量</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">MXFP4 后约 1.4TB</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">上下文</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">约 100 万 token</span></td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">@Fferr16 写得很直白：API 已经能用；「想本地跑」则是 </span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">1.4TB 起步</span></span><span leaf=\"\">，</span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">Blackwell／MI400 才能舒适装载</span></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">@StatsWire 补了一刀：人人会说 you can run it locally，诚实版本是——</span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">最少 8×H100 才能把权重 load 进机器</span></span><span leaf=\"\">；单张 RTX 4090，量化也跑不了。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">注意两档：</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">• </span><strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">能 load</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：参数塞进显存，服务能起来。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">• </span><strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">能当生产</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：吞吐、延迟、高可用、峰值不崩——另一张价目表。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">库存 </span><span style=\"background:#F4F4F5;color:#27272A;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">48G 单卡</span></span><span leaf=\"\">，连「能 load 全量 K3」这档都够不着。不是软件没配好，是物理体积不对。</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;margin:8px 0;\">\n  <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n  <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">02</span>\n    </p>\n    <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">COST</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">「算算本地要多少钱」</span>\n      </h3>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">X 上几乎同一天，出现了同一剧本——</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:28px 0 14px;padding:0 10px 0 22px;border-left:3px solid #52525B;line-height:1.4;margin-left:10px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">① @hppzyy：最少 64 张 H200</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<section style=\"background:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:20px 22px;margin:0 10px 28px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:500;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\">REFERENCE</span>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">Kimi K3 亮相后，老板让我算算本地化部署要多少钱。算完他沉默了。想本地跑？</span><strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">最少 64 张 H200 起步</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。显卡：64×H200（141GB）；网络：NVLink ＋ 800G 光模块 ＋ RDMA；CPU：双路 Xeon／EPYC；内存：每台 1–2TB DDR5。</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">原文：https://x.com/hppzyy/status/2081062901826433511</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:4px;margin:0 10px 8px;\">\n  <section style=\"margin:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/G54UQVjjFicmVkEunsMpnQR0xbxCC3b4kG5WceGV85ExgjDcLzNA8oQrB0PJcEianjEdls65MCR84wlydxBx8ibV5JG7kibyCeIMAo7ZiaC0oIf8/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;text-align:center;margin:0 10px 28px;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">— 来源 @hppzyy</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:28px 0 14px;padding:0 10px 0 22px;border-left:3px solid #52525B;line-height:1.4;margin-left:10px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">② @songexp：全量部署得花多少</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">同主题配图帖直接标题：</span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">全量部署 Kimi K3 得花多少？</span></span><span leaf=\"\"> 图上给出一版会让老板沉默的估算：</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"display:flex;margin:0 10px 28px;\"><section style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:22px 12px;margin-right:8px;text-align:center;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#27272A;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">¥3000万+</span></p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\"><span leaf=\"\">硬件一次性</span></p>\n  </section><section style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:22px 12px;margin-right:8px;text-align:center;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#27272A;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">¥91万/年</span></p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\"><span leaf=\"\">满载电费粗算</span></p>\n  </section><section style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:22px 12px;text-align:center;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#27272A;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">64×H200</span></p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\"><span leaf=\"\">起步卡数</span></p>\n  </section></section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 10px 24px;overflow-x:auto;\">\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;\">\n    <thead><tr><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">项</span></th><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">配图口径</span></th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">起步硬件</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">64×H200 ＋ 高速互联 ＋ 液冷 ＋ 单机柜约 160kW</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">硬件一次性</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">约 ¥3000 万＋</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">电费（满载年）</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">粗算约 ¥91 万／年（含 PUE）</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">未计入</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">场地、机房改造、运维编制……</span></td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border-left:3px solid #52525B;padding:16px 0 16px 24px;margin:0 10px 28px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\">「三千万只是起步。本地化部署大模型，从来都不是小老板的游戏。」</span>\n  </p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">原文：https://x.com/songexp/status/2081236228461265284</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:4px;margin:0 10px 8px;\">\n  <section style=\"margin:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/G54UQVjjFicnIS6feDTSItE553KYCVjIy29lIJBDvwg85OxNfvaE8FXqiaynYnKicq1cx09k02CB4WcicBAasKObNq4jIegJMHwVCAVODxb5jics/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;text-align:center;margin:0 10px 28px;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">— 来源 @songexp 成本信息图</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:28px 0 14px;padding:0 10px 0 22px;border-left:3px solid #52525B;line-height:1.4;margin-left:10px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">③ 英文侧的量级校验</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 10px 24px;overflow-x:auto;\">\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;\">\n    <thead><tr><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">来源</span></th><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">说法</span></th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">@ConstraintEdge</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">内部跑 K3 约 $1M＋ 硬件，未算电与 AI ops</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">@MrCollison</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">高可用推演：约 $11.7M 基建 ＋ $154k／月满载</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">@CircumjovialLLC</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">～$100k 家用级——与 64 卡生产档不是同一物种</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">@haider1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">更正：个人现实自托管 K3 不成立</span></td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">同一模型被估成十万美金玩具／百万美金入门／千万级人民币集群——不是吵架，是</span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">目标档位不同</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：演示 load ≠ 业务私有化。</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;margin:8px 0;\">\n  <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n  <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">03</span>\n    </p>\n    <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">REALITY</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">把库存 48G 放回坐标系</span>\n      </h3>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">假设公司库房是常见组合：若干台 48G 显存服务器、万兆以下网络、没有 NVLink 域、没有 7×24 AI 平台组。</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"margin:0 10px 24px;overflow-x:auto;\">\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;\">\n    <thead><tr><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">目标</span></th><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">社区门槛印象</span></th><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">48G 库存</span></th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">小模型／量化中小模型</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">可能</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">往往可行</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">Load 全量 K3（～1.4TB）</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">8×H100 起（仅 load）</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">不够</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">生产向全量</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">64 卡级 H200 ＋ 高速互联</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">差一个时代</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">高可用 ＋ 满载 TCO</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">千万美元级推演</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">不在同一讨论</span></td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">培训里「AI 能力不错」，证明团队会提示、会评审、会把模型嵌进研发流程；公司愿意买 </span><span style=\"background:#F4F4F5;color:#27272A;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">API／云托管／Coding Plan</span></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">它</span><strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">不证明</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：库存卡能私有化一套前沿 MoE。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">开放权重解决的是「有没有权下载」；私有化解决的是「有没有卡、有没有电、有没有人扛 SLA」。</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;margin:8px 0;\">\n  <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n  <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">04</span>\n    </p>\n    <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">ECONOMICS</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">就算买得起卡，账也不一定划算</span>\n      </h3>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">很多人默认：开源权重 ＋ 自托管 ＝ 一定更省钱。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">@cline 用生产流量算过一版（图示基于 Kimi K2.6 量级，并注明 </span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">K3 权重 footprint 约 3×</span></span><span leaf=\"\">，经济账会不同）：</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:4px;margin:0 10px 8px;\">\n  <section style=\"margin:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/G54UQVjjFicmVfic0a9kKHlLzgjJGBOAYhZECHFgGtuVUnQhYcGibJOro3ymDVfCbHuMjrpeOHl5Eu7md4VkKYH0TIl3iaG4H4ZZ2Ty1ARqYaIU/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;text-align:center;margin:0 10px 28px;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">— 来源 @cline · 自托管实际能省多少</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">要点：纯 API 相对地板规模自托管大约只 </span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">省约 10%</span></span><span leaf=\"\">；弹性与调优估计可到 20%–40%；前提往往是年 token 花费很高才值得认真做。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">对普通企业：数据不出域可以谈专有云／小模型本地；</span><strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">为了省钱上全量 K3 私有化</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">——多数时候，账算完会沉默。</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;margin:8px 0;\">\n  <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n  <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">05</span>\n    </p>\n    <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">BARRIERS</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">门槛清单：远超普通企业可承受</span>\n      </h3>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 10px 24px;overflow-x:auto;\">\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;\">\n    <thead><tr><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">门槛</span></th><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">为什么卡死 48G 库存方案</span></th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">显存体积</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">1.4TB 量级权重，不是「多插一张卡」</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">卡间互联</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">64 卡不是堆盒子，是 NVLink／超节点／光模块</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">电力与制冷</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">单机柜百千瓦级，普通办公楼机房没有这档</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">一次性 CAPEX</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">社区生产向估算：千万人民币级硬件起步</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">OPEX</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">电费一年可到百万量级；还有场地与值班</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">编制</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI ops／推理优化，不是「运维兼一下」</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">利用率账</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">中小企业 token 量不够时，自托管未必更便宜</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">目标错位</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">培训验收的是流程，不是机房资产周转</span></td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border-left:3px solid #52525B;padding:16px 0 16px 24px;margin:0 10px 28px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\">「开放权重降低了「授权门槛」，没有降低「算力门槛」。私有化部署前沿大模型，仍是超节点、资本开支、平台工程的事——不是十人研发团队培训结束后的库存机实验。」</span>\n  </p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;margin:8px 0;\">\n  <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n  <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">06</span>\n    </p>\n    <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">PATH</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">普通企业该怎么做</span>\n      </h3>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">不反对私有化，反对</span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">用错档位</span></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">1. 继续 API／兼容网关</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">——研发提效、Agent、代码助手，先用用量买能力。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">2. 本地只部署用得上的小模型</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">——脱敏、分类、RAG、轻量 coding：7B–70B ＋ 量化，往往才是 48G 卡的主场。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">3. 真要私有化前沿模型</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">——按 64 卡级 ＋ 机房改造 ＋ 三年 TCO 立项，不要包装成「库存试跑」。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">4. 验收标准分开</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">——培训验收：人会用、流程在；私有化验收：SLA、成本／千 token——另开项目。</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;margin:8px 0;\">\n  <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n  <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">∞</span>\n    </p>\n    <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">THE END</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">回到那个会议室</span>\n      </h3>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">董事长说：库存 48G，私有化部署一套 AI Coding 试试。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">合适的回答可以很短——</span><span style=\"background:#F4F4F5;color:#27272A;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">您先坐下</span></span><span leaf=\"\">：</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"border-left:3px solid #52525B;padding:16px 0 16px 24px;margin:0 10px 28px;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\">「试小模型／内部工具链，可以。试 K3 全量私有化，先按 64 卡与两三千万级硬件谈预算——社区估的电费一年还能再加近百万，还没算人和机房。培训证明的是团队能用 AI Coding；不能证明机房能吞下 2.8T。」</span>\n  </p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">X 上那些帖，剧本惊人一致：老板让算账 → 算完沉默 → 「公司开会讨论一下」。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">沉默，其实是健康的。它说明有人把 </span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">标题上的「开源」</span></span><span leaf=\"\"> 和 </span><span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">机房里的「可运行」</span></span><span leaf=\"\"> 重新分开了。</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:28px 0 14px;padding:0 10px 0 22px;border-left:3px solid #52525B;line-height:1.4;margin-left:10px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">来源（X 公开讨论，非厂商报价）</span>\n</p>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 10px 24px;overflow-x:auto;\">\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;\">\n    <thead><tr><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">主题</span></th><th style=\"background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">链接</span></th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">全量部署成本图</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">x.com/songexp/status/2081236228461265284</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">64×H200 清单</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">x.com/hppzyy/status/2081062901826433511</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">1.4TB／芯片门槛</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">x.com/Fferr16/status/2081236822747652440</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">8×H100 仅 load</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">x.com/StatsWire/status/2081236091802358174</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">$1M＋ 硬件</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">x.com/ConstraintEdge/status/2079712604050649330</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">$11.7M ＋ $154k／月</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">x.com/MrCollison/status/2081047199522115690</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">自托管节省 10%–25%＋</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;\"><span leaf=\"\">x.com/cline/status/2079301605179191716</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">个人自托管不现实</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;color:#52525B;background:#FAFAFA;\"><span leaf=\"\">x.com/haider1/status/2078473575250698411</span></td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">数字随行情与配置剧烈波动；本文只做量级对齐，不作采购依据。正式立项请以实测 profiling、厂商 BOM 与机房勘测为准。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:28px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n  <span leaf=\"\">ziikoo 研究院 · 大模型落地账本</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n  <section style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 36px;\">\n    <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n      <span style=\"height:1px;width:48px;background:#E4E4E7;margin-right:16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:500;\"><span leaf=\"\">END</span></span>\n      <span style=\"height:1px;width:48px;background:#E4E4E7;margin-left:16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"padding:0 10px 24px;\">\n  <section style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding-top:28px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#52525B;text-align:justify;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">我是 ziikoo 研究院，关注 AI 落地账本与工程实践。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#52525B;text-align:justify;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">如果你觉得今天这篇有收获，欢迎</span>\n      <strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">点赞、在看、转发</span></strong>\n      <span leaf=\"\">三连，我们下篇见。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>", "thumbMediaId": "xv9tsA2b6d4MzpARc-AiwOTan3CYmjLg3K62l0maBj31yiOEoEW3am7pOqGZrW63", "showCoverPic": 1, "needOpenComment": 0, "onlyFansCanComment": 0, "picCrop2351": "0_0_1_1"}]}